6,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moments&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/i/203815790?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f710f4-517f-4ae8-ba9d-1032f88776f8_1920x1080.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moments\" title=\"Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moments\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RuAW!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f710f4-517f-4ae8-ba9d-1032f88776f8_1920x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RuAW!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f710f4-517f-4ae8-ba9d-1032f88776f8_1920x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RuAW!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f710f4-517f-4ae8-ba9d-1032f88776f8_1920x1080.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RuAW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f710f4-517f-4ae8-ba9d-1032f88776f8_1920x1080.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>There is a quality of heart the teachings call <em>adhiṭṭhāna</em> — determination, resolve, <strong>the kind of commitment that holds steady when things get hard</strong>. </p><p>It isn’t sheer willpower, and it isn’t rigidity. <em>Adhiṭṭhāna</em> is something more grounded than that.</p><p>At my first Vipassana retreat, I learned what it really means to stay. </p><p>The instruction was simple: do your best not to move. No shifting posture, no opening your eyes. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1947\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1947,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:3682359,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moments&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/i/203815790?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moments\" title=\"Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moments\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hfx1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F769cd353-5589-4f2f-a806-30949faa5734_3702x4951.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I took it seriously, and what followed was some of the most intense discomfort I’d ever sat with. Physical pain, mental anguish, swirling anxiety, burning anger, the urge to get up and walk out. </p><p><strong>But I stayed.</strong> </p><p>And at some point, something changed. The pain was still there, but it no longer had the same hold on me. I felt calm, even aware. </p><p>That was my first real taste and cultivation of <em>adhiṭṭhāna</em>.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:113472,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moment&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/i/203815790?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moment\" title=\"Take A Pause: Committing Wholeheartedly | Erin Lee Mindful Moment\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!n0t1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4670cce2-06b8-4ed5-b3a5-c78ba16c07c8_1920x1080.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>In everyday life, we tend toward extremes — pushing hard, then giving up entirely when results don’t come quickly. </p><p><em>Adhiṭṭhāna</em> is what keeps us from falling back into that cycle. More than motivation, which comes and goes, <strong>this is a deeper commitment to staying the course</strong>.</p><p>And when we lapse? <em>We begin again</em>. That, too, is part of the practice.</p><div><hr></div><p><span>At Take A Pause Live over 27-28 June 2026, we dwelled in moment-by-moment awareness and learned to cultivate the capacity to stay, reminding ourselves of our wholehearted commitment to the practice. We closed the session with a reading from the book </span><a href=\"https://www.buddhistinquiry.org/article/the-first-free-women-poems-of-the-early-buddhist-nuns/\"><span>The First Free Women</span></a><span> by Matt Weingast.</span></p><p><strong>Meditation Practice</strong></p><blockquote><p><em><strong>Tap Play to Practice Together:</strong></em></p></blockquote><div class=\"native-audio-embed\" data-component-name=\"AudioPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;label&quot;:null,&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;e0c1ce72-5536-4e69-82cb-c2d9f1011ffc&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:1278.7983,&quot;downloadable&quot;:false,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}\"></div><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/p/committing-wholeheartedly?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">This post is free for some time, and then archived for paid subscribers to support a sustainable, long-term sharing of mindful content. Upgrade to receive lifetime access to the full archive and ongoing updates.</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/p/committing-wholeheartedly?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/p/committing-wholeheartedly?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><div><hr></div><h3><strong>The Wholehearted Woman Retreat</strong></h3><p><strong><span>A five-day mindfulness retreat into quiet wisdom and the light within</span><br><br></strong><span>1-5 October 2026</span><br><span>Siem Reap, Cambodia</span></p><p><span>*</span><em><span>Limited space available</span></em><br><br><span>Led by Erin Lee</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1941\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1941,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1309990,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;The Wholehearted Woman Retreat with Erin Lee in Siem Reap Cambodia&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Wholehearted Woman Retreat with Erin Lee in Siem Reap Cambodia&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://erinmindfulmoments.substack.com/i/195494180?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"The Wholehearted Woman Retreat with Erin Lee in Siem Reap Cambodia\" title=\"The Wholehearted Woman Retreat with Erin Lee in Siem Reap Cambodia\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IQsg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffd62b7f4-2d71-46b7-8460-c3a17574a16d_2296x3061.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://vigeoretreats.com/retreat/the-wholehearted-woman-retreat/&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Join Erin at Angkor Wat&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://vigeoretreats.com/retreat/the-wholehearted-woman-retreat/\"><span>Join Erin at Angkor Wat</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p></p>",
  "body_text": "There is a quality of heart the teachings call adhiṭṭhāna — determination, resolve, the kind of commitment that holds steady when things get hard. \n\nIt isn’t sheer willpower, and it isn’t rigidity. Adhiṭṭhāna is something more grounded than that.\n\nAt my first Vipassana retreat, I learned what it really means to stay. \n\nThe instruction was simple: do your best not to move. No shifting posture, no opening your eyes. \n\nI took it seriously, and what followed was some of the most intense discomfort I’d ever sat with. Physical pain, mental anguish, swirling anxiety, burning anger, the urge to get up and walk out. \n\nBut I stayed. \n\nAnd at some point, something changed. The pain was still there, but it no longer had the same hold on me. I felt calm, even aware. \n\nThat was my first real taste and cultivation of adhiṭṭhāna.\n\nIn everyday life, we tend toward extremes — pushing hard, then giving up entirely when results don’t come quickly. \n\nAdhiṭṭhāna is what keeps us from falling back into that cycle. More than motivation, which comes and goes, this is a deeper commitment to staying the course.\n\nAnd when we lapse? We begin again. That, too, is part of the practice.\n\n---\n\nAt Take A Pause Live over 27-28 June 2026, we dwelled in moment-by-moment awareness and learned to cultivate the capacity to stay, reminding ourselves of our wholehearted commitment to the practice. We closed the session with a reading from the book The First Free Women by Matt Weingast.\n\nMeditation Practice\n\nTap Play to Practice Together:\n\nThis post is free for some time, and then archived for paid subscribers to support a sustainable, long-term sharing of mindful content. Upgrade to receive lifetime access to the full archive and ongoing updates.\n\nShare\n\n---\n\nThe Wholehearted Woman Retreat\n\nA five-day mindfulness retreat into quiet wisdom and the light within\n\n1-5 October 2026\nSiem Reap, Cambodia\n\n*Limited space available\n\nLed by Erin Lee\n\nJoin Erin at Angkor Wat\n\n---",
